@startuml
autonumber
actor Rider
participant "Web adapter" as Web
participant "Rental use case" as App
participant "Provider port" as Port
participant "City Bike adapter" as Adapter
participant "City Bike API" as Api
participant "Rental domain" as Domain

Rider -> Web: request a bike rental
Web -> App: start rental
App -> Domain: check rental rules
App -> Port: start with provider
Port -> Adapter: route to City Bike
Adapter -> Api: send City Bike request
Api --> Adapter: provider response
Adapter --> App: common confirmation
App -> Domain: create Rental
App --> Web: rental ID
Web --> Rider: rental created
@enduml